WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.150 --> 00:00:03.325
Let’s run one complete leg, start to finish.

2
00:00:03.575 --> 00:00:05.400
Look at the diagram.

3
00:00:05.650 --> 00:00:08.300
You’re going from buoy one to bell two.

4
00:00:08.550 --> 00:00:10.250
Draw the line.

5
00:00:10.500 --> 00:00:13.200
Walk the parallel rulers to the rose.

6
00:00:13.450 --> 00:00:15.750
They read zero six eight true.

7
00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:20.250
Set the dividers on the two marks, and carry them to the side scale.

8
00:00:20.500 --> 00:00:22.900
They span five point three minutes.

9
00:00:23.150 --> 00:00:26.125
So the distance is five point three miles.

10
00:00:26.375 --> 00:00:28.375
You’re making twelve knots.

11
00:00:28.625 --> 00:00:30.450
How long will it take?

12
00:00:30.700 --> 00:00:34.525
Sixty times five point three, divided by twelve.

13
00:00:35.525 --> 00:00:37.775
Twenty-six and a half minutes.

14
00:00:38.025 --> 00:00:40.000
You leave at nine hundred.

15
00:00:40.250 --> 00:00:43.225
So you arrive at about nine twenty-seven.

16
00:00:43.475 --> 00:00:45.400
That’s lesson three.

17
00:00:45.650 --> 00:00:48.475
Course above the line, speed below.

18
00:00:48.725 --> 00:00:50.650
Three digits, always.

19
00:00:50.900 --> 00:00:53.100
Distance from the side scale.

20
00:00:53.350 --> 00:00:56.400
Next time: speed, time and distance.
